<title>USA: Florida plans $200 mln GO sale for Thursday.</title>
<headline>Florida plans $200 mln GO sale for Thursday.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Florida said it plans to sell $200 million of general obligation bonds at 1100 EDT on Thursday.</p>
<p>The sale will be competitive. --U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
